---
import H1 from "../components/h1.astro";
import InfoLayout from "../layouts/InfoLayout.astro";
---

<InfoLayout title="Career Development — Gabriel">
  <div class="p-4 sm:pt-8 sm:px-12 pb-20 min-h-dvh flex flex-col gap-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <H1>Career Development</H1>
    
    <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
      Ma vision de carrière, mes certifications et mon plan de développement professionnel.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-zinc-800/60 border border-zinc-700 rounded-xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-yellow-500"><path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"/><path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"/><path d="M4 22h16"/><path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"/><path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"/><path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2Z"/></svg>
          Certifications
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-6">
          <li class="flex flex-col gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-500">✅</span>
              <span class="text-zinc-100 font-medium italic italic">Imperial College London</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm ml-7">Mathématique avancée pour l'apprentissage automatique (3 semaines)</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-col gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-500">✅</span>
              <span class="text-zinc-100 font-medium italic italic">Stanford University</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm ml-7">Algorithme de Machine Learning avancée (2 mois)</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-col gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-500">✅</span>
              <span class="text-zinc-100 font-medium italic italic">University of Colorado</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm ml-7">VHDL pour la conception de FPGA (2 semaines)</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-zinc-800/60 border border-zinc-700 rounded-xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-blue-500"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/></svg>
          Formations & Conférences
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="p-4 bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-700/50 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-zinc-200 font-medium mb-1 italic">Gestion et Management</p>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm italic italic">Gestion de projet, management, ingénieur du futur</p>
          </li>
          <li class="p-4 bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-700/50 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-zinc-200 font-medium mb-1 italic">Durable & Tech</p>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm italic italic">RSE, éco-ingénierie, finance verte, Green-AI</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-800/40 border border-zinc-700 rounded-xl p-8 md:col-span-2">
        <h2 class="text-zinc-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-8 text-center">Partenaires & Institutions de formation</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8 opacity-60 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500">
          <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">EY</span>
          <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl italic italic">ENGIE</span>
          <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl uppercase italic">Alten</span>
          <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl italic italic">BNP PARIBAS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-800/60 border border-zinc-700 rounded-xl p-8 md:col-span-2">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-semibold mb-6">Projet Professionnel Personnalisé (PPP)</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Retrouvez ci-dessous mon dossier complet de Projet Professionnel Personnalisé. Ce document détaille ma réflexion sur mon parcours, mes aspirations et ma stratégie de carrière.
        </p>

        <div class="w-full aspect-[1/1.4] sm:aspect-video rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-900 shadow-2xl">
          <iframe 
            src="/PPP_Kpodoh_Gabriel.pdf" 
            class="w-full h-full border-none"
            title="PPP - Gabriel Kpodoh"
          >
          </iframe>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-6 flex justify-end">
          <a 
            href="/PPP_Kpodoh_Gabriel.pdf" 
            download 
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-2 bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-900 font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-white transition-colors"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/>
            </svg>
            Télécharger le document
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</InfoLayout>
